window.products.push({"id":330046,"name":"BB Brotrade Reusable Mesh Produce Bags,Premium Lightweight Washable Eco Friendly Bags with Tare Weight on Tags for Grocery Shopping Storage, Fruit, Ve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615hDcqwvJL._AC_SL1157_.jpg","description":"【BREATHABLE&WASHABLE】 Our breathable mesh bags are machine washable, and come with the most vibrant pastel tag colors. They are made with the highest standards of quality, ideal part of an Eco-friendly lifestyle.The reusable mesh produce bag washable will save more plastic bags in a long run. 【MULTI-PURPOSE】Our premium bags are not just for produce though,it can use to store almost any household item.With so many different sizes they also work great for laundry delicate,small sports equipment, beach trips, gym clothes, camping trips, road trips, fruit, and virtually any form of household organizing you can imagine. 【DURABLE MATERIAL】It is made of strong,lightweight,easy-to-see-through mesh polyester,Plastic-free & save the environment.Reusable produce bags are completely transparent for airflow and visibility. They are sheer enough for the barcodes to run through them, enabling you to swiftly pass through checkout with your purchases. No need to waste time double handling your produce when you get home from the market, simply wash the produce in the bag, allow to dry, put away and enjoy an organized fridge 【MULTI-SIZE】Each reusable produce bag is color-coded for perfect identification and organization. The bold labels show the tare weight in ounces, pounds, and grams and proudly sport the brand name.A set 12 pieces Reusable Grocery Produce Bags in 3 size: 3PCS Large size(17\"*12\"),6PCS Medium size(14\"*12\"),3PCS Small size (8\"*12\") 【STRENGTH&DURABILITY】The drawstring is conventient for opening and closing. Our double-stitched bags can safely hold up to 11 pounds. Despite their strength, our bags are still see-through and light-weight , saving you time and money when you are shopping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615hDcqwvJL._AC_SL1157_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BB Brotrade","source_asin":"B072QWGWKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072QWGWKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072QWGWKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
