window.products.push({"id":330049,"name":"Lodge Prologic Silicone Hot Handle Holder, Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pftos1xQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This red silicone handle holder is heat-resistant and a great addition to any kitchen. Just slide the holder onto the hot handle and remove pots and pans with ease. The special silicone offers protection up to 450-Degree and creates a safe and comfortable grip of hot cookware handles. This handle holder is flexible enough to store compactly in a drawer. Ideal for use with Lodge Prologic items P10S3, P12S3, P12SGR3 and P12SG5. Available in a rainbow of different colors and is dishwasher-safe. Fits Lodge Pro-Logic assist handles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pftos1xQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodge","source_asin":"B00V65VFLG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00V65VFLG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00V65VFLG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":330050,"name":"Isaac Jacobs 8x10 Wall-Mountable Clear Acrylic Picture Frame, Magnetic Photo Frame, Made for Gallery Display, Wall Space, Wall Décor, Art, Home or Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aPl+ePq7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Isaac Jacobs Wall-Mountable Clear Acrylic Frame will transform any drab walls in your home. The modern frame put your taste in art and photography on display and shows off your beautiful photos, both vertically and horizontally. Grab the eye of anyone who walks into your hallway or living room when you hang precious photographs or awe-inspiring architecture photos in this gorgeous frame. It is an ideal choice to display the big moments in life, like weddings, birthdays and your child’s first days of school. Take your favorite shots of the world around you and turn them into beautiful wall art. You will enjoy how easy it is to replace photos. All it takes is a quick slide of the front acrylic pane. Place a new photo in the clear middle pane that will give your photographs the appealing floating effect. There is no need to detach the frame from the wall to replace photos! The strong magnets on the four corners of the panes secures the frame tight. The ease that it takes to switch out photos, may inspire you to display more of your favorite photos. Show off your child’s first haircut. Preserve your parents’ memories or showcase the moments that tell the story of the life you are building. This frame’s sizes range from 4”x 6” to 16” x 20”, including our document size frame, which is ideal for diplomas, award certificates, or letters of achievement. With multiple frames you can create a series of happy baby photos or show off a set of inspiring architectural prints that will reflect your personal taste. This chic frame has a contemporary appeal and it makes an ideal gift choice for any occasion. We spend so much time flipping through images on screens all day, it feels good to see our memories and passions preserved in style. [NOTES: (1) Do not use glass cleaner on acrylic. (2) The frame has no easel. Wall use only]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aPl+ePq7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B075324BVV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075324BVV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075324BVV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
