window.products.push({"id":330298,"name":"AI TAO Modern Simplicity Round 47 Inch Tablecloth Washable Cotton Wrinkle Waterproof Fabrics Table Cover Great for Indoor & Outdoor Party - Light Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ypF35yHrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The practical waterproof and wrinkle free tablecloth will protect your coffee table, dining table, folding table, sideboards and desks from scratches and stains, as indoor tablecloth or outdoor table covers for party birthday, picnic and camping. A good choice for spring tablecloth and summer tablecloth. HOW TO CHOOSE A MOST SUITABLE SIZE TABLE CLOTH 1. Tablecloth size ≠ table size. For example, oblong tablecloth 60x84 inch is not large enough for round tables size as 60x84 inch,it fits tables size from 36x60 to 44x68 inch, as table covers for 6 foot tables. 2. Leave enough length to drop. 8''-12'' dropping for each side is recommended. You can easily calculate your tablecloth size by the following formula. Tablecloth Length = Table Length + 16\"-24\" (40-60cm) Tablecloth Width = Table Width + 16\"-24\" (40-60cm) TIPS: 1.Please measure your tabletop dimensions of length, width before purchasing the tablecloth. 2.Please allow 1-2 cm error due to manual measurement. 3.Colors of pictures and objects may be off due to differences in the monitor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ypF35yHrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AI TAO","source_asin":"B09VP1GVKT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330298","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VP1GVKT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VP1GVKT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
