window.products.push({"id":330375,"name":"Teal Dinner Plates Set of 4(10.5-Inch,4-Piece),Stoneware/Porcelain Dinner Plates Set,Turquoise Ceramic Dinner Plates,Turquoise Dishes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OWKH7VPmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"[Pick the right set for your lifestyle,find a comfortable weight,consider the size and shape of each piece]-- Size: 10.5 Inch. Healthy glaze: Pb-Free,enough to meet daily needs,dishwasher, microwave, oven safe (up to 350 degrees fahrenheit) & freezer safe with Beautiful & Complex Color Glaze. [Choosing a set of dinnerware is a big decision]--Since it’s something you’ll use on a daily basis and for special occasions—everything from a morning bowl of cereal to a holiday dinner with family and friends. Finding a dinnerware color you love is important, but factors such as weight and durability should also play a role in your selection. [Why you should trust me]--Our company is in Jingdezhen, the ceramic capital of China and offers a variety of cutlery for families and restaurants around the world, including plates, salad plates, soup bowls and coffee cups. [How much to buy (and to spend) ]--Before you start shopping, decide how many place settings to get and how much you want to spend. We recommend four to six place settings for a two-person household, and eight to 12 settings for a household of four or five.Generally ppl prefer open-stock sets because they offer you the flexibility to pick and choose the pieces, you can replace a single chipped or broken plate without buying another complete place setting. [Material]--The tableware we sell on Amazon uses stoneware, which is a ceramic made from unrefined clay that fires at very high temperatures. It is thicker and stronger than porcelain and bone china. And it is very beautiful in the glaze process. Suitable for more families.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OWKH7VPmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Warebest","source_asin":"B07CFWV2SM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CFWV2SM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CFWV2SM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
