window.products.push({"id":330495,"name":"Color Changing Sublimation Glass Cups with Lids and Glass Straws 6Pack,16oz Glass Sublimation Cups With Bamboo Lid,Frosted Glass Cups with Lids and St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iS8GAVu6L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"🧊【Cold Color Changing Cups with Lids and Straws】When you pour cold drinks to the glass cups with lids and straws, it'll change to a certain color (varies with the glass, 6 colors in total) of different shades (varies with the temperature of the drink), adding extra fun and colors to your life! 🎁【Sublimation Glass Can,Sublimation Glass Blanks with Bamboo Lid,Amazing DIY Gifts】The frosted Sublimation Glass Blanks with Bamboo Lid has a quality sublimation coating, so it is ready for sublimation. You can add any patterns to the sublimation glass cups to prepare a unique DIY gift for your friends and family members. Note that you might need a sublimation solution (such as the printer and sublimation machine, NOT included) before sublimate the set of glass sublimation cups with bamboo lid. 🍻【Drinking Glasses with Glass Straw Suitable for Various Occasions】Trendy and stylish beer can shaped glass cup with lid and straw design, suitable for holding beverages, beer, cocktails, soda, coffee, water, etc in various situations such as weddings, parties, get-togethers, dinners, datings, and daily use. The set of frosted sublimation glass with bamboo lid can also be used as mason jar cups to serve as wonderful decorations to your parties. 🥤【Durable and Safe, No Leakage】The glass cups with lids and straws bamboo is made of premium lead-free and BPA-free borosilicate glass material, which can withstand a sudden temperature change between 14°F to 392°F, so you can use the beer can glasses with lid and straw to hold either iced or hot drinks freely. Soft silicone rings around the cup lid and the straw hole ensure that your drink in the cup will not spill out even when you use the cup in travel or on a car. 📩【Safe Package and 100% Satisfaction Customer Service】The can tumbler with lid and straw set is packaged in a rugged bubble holder and thick carton box to prevent damage in transport. Our 7x24 online service provides 100% satisfactory customer service. For any problems about the glass with lid and straw set, please contact us directly. Package includes: 6 x sublimation glass can(6 different colors), 3 x curved clear glass straws, 3 x straight clear glass straws, 3 x cleaning brushes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iS8GAVu6L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homegician","source_asin":"B0C5X6JJPZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5X6JJPZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5X6JJPZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
