window.products.push({"id":330522,"name":"Tempura Deep Fryer Pot (3.2L/3.4qt) 18/8 Stainless Steel Deep Frying Pan with Thermometer and Oil Drip Drainer Rack 9.5 inch Japanese Style Tempura Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713uE0dREaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Stainless Material Made of food-grade 304 stainless, this tempura frying pot with thermometer is durable and has good heat insulation performance, heating rapidly and evenly.Precise Temperature Control Help you check the ideal temperature needed for different kinds of food and allow you to fry food to the best taste.Oil Drain Rack The oil drain rack forms an oil filtration & drain system to drain the excess oil of the food back to the japanese frying pot and reduce grease intake. Pouring Spout Design The pouring spout design makes it easier to pour out the cooking oil without worrying about the oil drip down during the dumping process. Comfortable Handle The riveted curved handle is safe and firm to conveniently grip. Temperature Recommended: 150°C-160°C French fries, fried potatoes, fried eggplant 160°C-170°C Fried sweet potato, fried lotus root, croquette, pork chop 170°C-180°C Fried squid, fish, shrimp, chicken nuggets, crackersWhat Will You Get? 1 x Deep Fry Pot(Capacity: 3.2 Liters/3.4 Quart) 1 x Kitchen Tongs 1 x Fry Thermometer 1 x User Manual ⚠Important Reminders:  1. Keep away from children when the tempura deep fryer pot 3.2L is hot to avoid scalding! 2. Do not wash the thermometer with water, please wipe it with a cleaning cloth or a paper towel. 3.The surface of the thermometer is plastic, please take it out when the temperature over 200℃. 4. Do not wash directly with cold water when the pot is hot to avoid deforming or warping. 5.The japanese stainless deep frying pot is dishwasher safe, please take the thermometer out before cleaning. Take the lid and drain rack off from the pot for better clean in dishwasher safe. 6.Using excessive oil can cause hot oil and food to splash out of the deep fry pot. Oil does not exceed 1/2 of pot (1.6L) is recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713uE0dREaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUTTIRA","source_asin":"B08LST9L71","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LST9L71","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LST9L71","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
