window.products.push({"id":330574,"name":"Flexzion Wine Bottle Vacuum Pump Sealer Preserver Saver with 2 Push Botton Stoppers Home Kitchen Bar Tool Accessory Portable in Silver Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DGnd0k85L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The vacuum pump wine preserver allows you to save those bottles of wine for longer. Simply use the stopper, pump air out of the wine bottle, and you can you leave your wine fresh for days. A wine stopper is an essential wine accessory to close leftover wine bottles before refrigerating them. Wine stoppers are used because it is hard to put the original cork back into the bottleneck. Some wine stoppers can be vacuum-sealed with a hand pump, to remove oxygen from the bottle, thereby extending the life of the wine by several days after opening the bottle. Package Content: 1x Wine Bottle Vacuum Sealer 1x Wine Bottle Vacuum Sealer 2x Bottle Stoppers 2x Bottle Stoppers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DGnd0k85L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flexzion","source_asin":"B07V9MLZLY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V9MLZLY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V9MLZLY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
