window.products.push({"id":330625,"name":"ZAMAT Premium Gel Memory Foam Pillow, Breathable & Supportive Bed Pillow for Sleeping, Hypoallergenic Cooling Pillow with Washable, Removable Cover, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kAykIUJPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[SAY GOODBYE TO NIGHT SWEATS] \"If you sleep hot, a pillow that sleeps cooler would be a worthwhile investment in your sleep quality, which is an investment in your health,\" says clinical sleep educator. ZAMAT bed pillow is that choice right for you. Using the latest gel-infused memory foam technology, it regulates temperature and reduces heat build-up on the surface of the pillow. Moreover, this sleep pillow has many tiny holes that increases breathability and promotes heat escaping. [SOFT & SUPPORTIVE MEMORY FOAM] ZAMAT gel pillow conforms and adapts to your unique shape and supports your head and neck, keeps you feel comfortable and cooling all night, have a full night sleep. Our pillow combined with gel, the density of gel makes the pillow high support and slow rebound, give support to neck and effectively relieve neck pressure. With two different sizes to choose from and a comfortable mid-loft design, this cooling pillow is great for back, stomach, and side sleepers. [ALL-NATURAL & ODORLESS PILLOW ] If you're sensitive to the smell of a memory foam pillow's off-gassing and want a natural and healthy pillow, try ours ZAMAT odorless cervical pillow! Our ergonomic memory foam pillows have been rigorously tested and certified by CertiPUR-US and OEKO-TEX to ensure safety for you and your family. All materials are chemical-free for better health. Please absolutely relax using our sleeping pillow since the material is safe. [DOUBLE PILLOWCASE FOR A LUXURY EXPERIENCE] The double pillowcase design is built to maintain quality through multiple pieces of washing to ensure a simple and fresh experience night after night. Our hypoallergenic pillowcases created with tencel fabric and polyester fiber, feels silky soft while providing dust protection. The outer pillowcase is machine washable, however, tumble dry at a low setting to ensure unaltered comfort. [THOUGHTFUL GIFT & 100% SATISFACTION] ZAMAT sleep innovations contour pillow is presented to you in a beautiful gift box, which is a perfect gift for your family and friend, suitable for everyone included child and elderly. This neck support pillow will brings sweet and cooling sleep for you in this hot summer, Every pillow will enjoy 100 nights of risk-free use. Your 100% satisfaction is guaranteed, feel free to contact us if you have any question.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kAykIUJPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZAMAT","source_asin":"B08VD7WS1K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VD7WS1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VD7WS1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
