window.products.push({"id":330823,"name":"Yifely Grey and White Furniture Protective Paper for Cabinets Damask Shelf Drawer Liner Roll Easy Apply 17.7 Inch by 13 Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wyV2bcs5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Instruction For Use:1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, board, wood cabinet,drawer,walls,window,glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature.2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water.3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is beter.4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth.5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out.This multi-purpose drawer paper can protect the furniture from humidity and dirt efficiently.A adorable furniture accessories for your daily home life.Wide:45cmLength: 4MPlease allow 3~7cm deviation as they are manual cutting. If you buy more than two items, we may package your order into ONE ROLL with the toal length you ordered together in one parcel. But our other warehouse in England will send seperated roll. Please be noted.Material: PVCPackage Included: One RollNote:1.Color tones can vary due to lighting in the room, pictures on wall for reference only.2.Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference.3. Wallpaper you will receive may have some wrinkles on it or both ends, but it do not effect looking after use on dry flat surface.4. Storage methods: stored at cool, dry and ventilated place. Because of PVC material, you can put it in a ventilated place to remove the vinyl smell.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wyV2bcs5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yifely","source_asin":"B07CQLJFDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CQLJFDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CQLJFDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
