window.products.push({"id":330847,"name":"artgeist Handart Canvas Wall Art Woman 35x24 in - 1pcs Painting Canvas Prints Picture Artwork Image Framed Contemporary Modern Wall Home Portrait Abst","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NoDBVMUQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wall paintings in the HandArt technique The use of this technology adds a special effect to the canvas print – it makes it look like a handmade painting. How is this possible? The HandArt technique involves transparent acrylic gel that is applied on the surface of the canvas print and thus it obtains a unique and characteristic gloss. The high-quality gel is applied manually which results in original brush or spatula strokes visible on the surface. The gel does not include any toxic substances and it additionally protects the HandArt picture against harmful external factors. Canvas prints – an individually arranged space A high variety of motifs for every room. We offer a wide range of designs which will add a decorative touch to the walls in your house or flat. Thanks to the unique diversity of themed pictures and high-quality materials our designs will meet even the most demanding taste. Check our pictures which fit perfectly any living room, bedroom, kitchen, dining room or children’s room.Best price and highest quality! All our products are made in our own manufacturing facility. We do not have any items in stock – each one is produced on the individual customer’s order and dispatched directly from the plant.In case the picture consists of more than one piece, please remember to keep a distance of 2-3 cm between them. Otherwise the whole motive will not match.IMPORTANT: DELIVERY TO A PARCEL LOCKER AND PERSONAL COLLECTION ARE NOT POISSIBLE!All our products belong to the Artgeist brand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NoDBVMUQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"artgeist","source_asin":"B08XC1SKF9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XC1SKF9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XC1SKF9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
