window.products.push({"id":330954,"name":"TLT Personalized Imprinted Gold Medal Contemporary 30\" Bar Height Walnut Frame Directors Chair - Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":171.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UYjga2twL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Customization Instructions - Simply click \"Customize Now\" to begin personalizing your new chair! We offer one line of text included with the chair in your choice of many fonts and colors. In the Location of Inscription box, type in either Front or Back. Type in your inscription exactly as you want it on the chair, we will personalize it exactly as it is typed. If you would like to add an extra line, you must choose Yes from the dropdown box under \"Would you like an extra line of text.\" Enter in all of your extra line information in the extra line of text box. If you would like it on the same side as the included line, choose \"Under the included line\" and we will center both lines on the same side. If you would like it on the opposite side, choose \"On other side of the chair\". If information is entered here and you have chosen no in the \"Would you like an EXTRA line of text?\" box, all of the extra line information will be ignored. happy personalizing! Imprinting Process Description - The heat imprint process is just like sign making - letters are computer cad cut from vinyl and then applied to the fabric under high heat and pressure, fusing the vinyl into the fabric permanently. The result looks almost identical to silk screening and is just as durable and professional looking. Chair Description - The Contemporary Directors Chair offers value and quality at a great price. This chair is made in the USA from locally managed Appalachian beech hardwoods. All joints are hand fitted and glued with steel underpinning to insure tight and lasting rigidity. Strong joints are the most important factor in long lived director's chairs. The seat and back fabric are made from heavy duty 15 oz. cotton canvas which is washable and colorfast. Finally, this chair has a 3-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UYjga2twL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TLT","source_asin":"B01MT8LKCH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MT8LKCH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MT8LKCH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":330955,"name":"Homsof Velvet Accent Chair Modern Ergonomics Armchair Living Room Chaise Lounge Single Sofa with Black Wood Legs, one Size, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":226.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xt3TRs1kS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Item Width: 29.5\"  Item Depth: 29.5\"  Item Weight: 40.26 pounds  Package Weight: 48.4 pounds  Package Size: 30.32\"x14.76\"x28.35\" Item Height: 34.6\"  Chair back height: 18.5\"  Seat height: 18.1\"  Armrest height: 22.4\"  Base depth: 29.5\"  Base width: 29.5\"  Seat depth: 21.6\"  Seat width: 20.4\"  Armrest depth: 20.47\"  Upholstered: Yes  Upholstery Material: Velvet Back Type: Tight back  Weight Capacity: 250 Pounds  Frame Material: Wood  Arms Included: Yes  Ottoman Included: No  Leg Color: Black  Swivel: No  Seat Construction: MDF Toss Pillows Included: No  Product Care: Spot wipes clean with a soft, dry cloth Number of Chairs Included: 1  Legs Material: Solid Wood  Level of Assembly: Partial Assembly  Adult Assembly Required: Yes   1. Dimensions: 29.5\"W x 29.5\"D x 34.6\"H.  2. The Velvet upholstered accent chair features a padded seat, curved back and neat arm, which can hold you like embracing in the arms, and keep you lounging and relaxing in cushioned comfort.  3. Soft and durable skin-friendly fabric cover, wood frame matches the high density foam, tapering metal legs and universal foot stops with a golden finish ensure added stability and luxury style.  4. The elegant and delicate velvet upholstery offers a rich, luxury appeal, making the decoration equally perfect in living room, dining room, home office and even corner.  5. Assemble in 15 minutes or less; Spot wipe clean with a soft, dry cloth.  6. 250 pounds of load bearing, allowing large bodies to work without fear.  7. Ergonomic inclining backrest.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xt3TRs1kS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homsof","source_asin":"B0B5Y8WW4S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5Y8WW4S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5Y8WW4S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":330956,"name":"Ultra Soft & Exquisitely Smooth Genuine 100% Plush Cotton Crisp Percale Sheets, 18\" Deep Pockets Elastic All Around, 5 Piece Solid Split King (Adjusta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31p3EMkmdVL._AC_.jpg","description":"These luxurious 300 count Egyptian linens are some of the most sought after sheets for the discerning Plush Cotton connoisseur. Discover why Plush Cotton percale sheets are sought after by so many. What is the secret to Plush Cotton? Plush Cotton fibers are twice as long as a standard cotton fiber. A longer fibers creates a finer spun yarn. The longer fiber gives 300 count Plush Cotton sheets their signature drape and softness. Breathable Crispy Soft Percale sheets collection by Abripedic. Percale stands for the weaving process in which the fabric is woven by. In percale sheets the yarns are woven in one over one, unlike Sateen where it?s four over one. The one over one (percale) weave create a much even, stronger, denser & softer yet crispy fabric, which can stand the test of time and gets better and better feel the more you wash it. just like your an old favorite shirt, the more it?s laundered the softer and more durable it gets. Long staple, 100% Plush Cotton yarns are woven into this sumptuous fabric and then double-finished to create the ultimate in soft sheets, pillowcases, duvet covers, pillow shams and accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31p3EMkmdVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegant Bedding","source_asin":"B0118F6DNI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0118F6DNI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0118F6DNI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
