window.products.push({"id":330962,"name":"Kiera Grace 2 by 3-Inch Tri-Layer LED Pillar Candles, Mini, Citrus and Sage Fragrance, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QXAOWKIRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Want the ambience and romance of candles in your home or outdoor spaces, without the hassle or smoke? The Kiera Grace 2 pack Tri colored LED battery candles are perfect for you. Our LED candles look just like flame burning candles, except they use battery operated lights that slowly flicker, mimicking a real wick-burning candle. They have a textured look and are scented with a rich fragrance. Each 2\" x 3\" LED candle runs on batteries that are included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QXAOWKIRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kiera Grace","source_asin":"B017YNWEUE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017YNWEUE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017YNWEUE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":330963,"name":"Churchill China Brook Pink 47-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51S78E8AEAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Brook Pink dinnerware is produced by utilising the centuries old art of transfer printing from original engravings which bring to life the scenes of an English rural countryside. The Cottages, Churches, Brooks & landscapes are long forgotten in this modern world however they do still exist & we at Churchill try to bring the best out in these scenes by reproducing our ceramics the way our forefathers did in the 18th Century. Each Piece is processed and handled at least 50 times before it is finally made ready for our customers. This vintage feel is applied to all 47 Items in the Dinner Set for Eight, which consists of Eight complete place settings, perfect for either Casual or Formal Dining:- 10inch Dinner Plate, 7inch Bread & Butter Plate, 6inch Soup/Cereal Bowl, Tea Cups & saucers, 1x Oval Platter 12\", 1 x Open Vegetable Dish 9.25\" dia, 1 x Tea Pot 6 Cup 1 x Creamer, 1 x Covered Sugar Bowl. Manufactured in fine earthenware, Brook Pink Dinnerware products are both Microwave & Dishwasher safe. This collection is endorsed by Churchill China with its 200 years of history in the manufacture of dinnerware for the home. Amazon.com Serene and cozy, Churchill China's Brook Blue dinnerware displays authentic renderings of English countryside estates in a feminine palette of soft reds, pinks, and white. Showcasing a selection of rustic scenes with stone buildings, massive trees, lush meadows, and meandering brooks, each piece draws the viewer into its own special landscape, while together the collection creates a charmingly panoramic dining backdrop. Unifying the designs, a sumptuous basket- weave and grapevine border frames every piece, and wavy sculpting on the rims and bodies provides a textured overall finish. Because these lovely drawings are transferred directly from original engravings, Brook Blue's effect is both intimate and lush at any traditional table. An inclusive set appropriate for large families as well as gracious entertaining, this 47-piece collection includes eight 5-piece place settings, each with a 10-inch dinner plate, a 7-inch bread and butter plate, a 6-inch soup/cereal bowl, a 5-1/2-inch saucer, and an 8-ounce teacup. Rounding out the set, the seven completer pieces include a 12-inch oval platter, a 9-1/4-inch open vegetable dish, a 6-cup teapot, a 7-ounce creamer, and an 8-ounce covered sugar bowl. The Brook Pink line is crafted from high-fired earthenware with a chip-resistant glossy glaze. Designed to withstand frequent use, it goes safely into the microwave, freezer, and dishwasher. --Kara Karll What's in the Box 8 place settings, 7 serving pieces. Each place setting consists of: 10-inch dinner plate; 7-inch bread and butter plate; 6-inch soup/cereal bowl; 5-1/2-inch saucer; 8-ounce teacup. Service set consists of: 12-inch oval platter; 9-1/4-inch open vegetable dish; 6-cup teapot; 7-ounce creamer; 8-ounce covered sugar bowl. 47 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51S78E8AEAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Churchill China","source_asin":"B0007OV74M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-330963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007OV74M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007OV74M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
